        {
          "ruleId": "owasp-audit/CWE-1321/src/routes/notes.js/PATCH-note-merge",
          "ruleIndex": 2,
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "Needs validation: Prototype pollution through _.merge of the JSON request body in PATCH /api/notes/:id. Blockers: Whether lodash 4.17.15's _.merge writes '__proto__' or 'constructor.prototype' keys from a JSON.parse'd source through to Object.prototype. The library code is not vendored in the repo. Validation plan: In the repo root after `npm ci`, run: node -e \"const _=require('lodash'); console.log(_.VERSION); _.merge({}, JSON.parse('{\\\"__proto__\\\":{\\\"polluted1\\\":1}}')); _.merge({}, JSON.parse('{\\\"constructor\\\":{\\\"prototype\\\":{\\\"polluted2\\\":1}}}')); console.log(({}).polluted1, ({}).polluted2)\". Confirmed: '4.17.15' then a 1 for either value. Then rate impact via the notes.js:13 -> :15 ORDER BY gadget, e.g. pollute a key 'x' and call GET /api/notes?sort=x. Rejected: '4.17.15' then 'undefined undefined', ruled out by lodash's merge key guard at the pinned version."
          },
